# Diagram — explicit sequence diagram for analyzer post-processing
#
# Covers Mermaid sequenceDiagram / DiagramSequence. This is distinct
# from a flowchart: the answer must preserve call order across the
# analyzer deterministic post-processing chain and still explain the
# major hops in prose/list form.
ID="qf_sequence_analyzer_gate"
NAME="diagram — sequence buildAnalysisIR to gate.Run"
QUESTION="请用 Mermaid 时序图展示 analyzer.go 里 buildAnalysisIR 到 gate.Run 的调用顺序，并在图后列出关键中间函数。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="buildAnalysisIR gate.Run"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX='(```mermaid|sequenceDiagram)'
# Key-intermediate selection remains model-owned: requiring one specific early
# helper overfits a 235-call orchestration body. The structural oracle below
# keeps the actual reachable edge and exact endpoint boundary edge, while the
# ordinary answer shape already requires the requested intermediate list.
EXPECT_MATCHES_TEXT_REGEX='buildAnalysisIR.*gate\.RunWith.*analyzer\.go:[0-9]+
gate\.Run([^A-Za-z0-9_]|$).*RunWith.*gate\.go:[0-9]+'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="runTaskGraph DesignReviewer 系统按已验证证据补充 System-verified"
